# Ignore rules for apps/frontend/Dockerfile.
#
# Named `Dockerfile.dockerignore` on purpose: BuildKit reads it instead of a
# `.dockerignore` at the context root, so the frontend and backend images keep
# separate allow-lists. Paths are relative to this repo's root, the context.
#
# Allow-list: exclude everything, then re-include only what the frontend image
# needs. Local .env files and the .npmrc credentials stay out; only the
# committed .env.production (public VITE_* values, no secrets) goes in.
# (Registry auth arrives as a BuildKit secret instead.)

*

# Workspace manifests: the lockfile resolves every importer. .pnpmfile.cjs is
# a no-op in the image, but the lockfile records its checksum.
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.pnpmfile.cjs
!scripts/check-lockfile.mjs
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/backend/package.json

# This app's own client and the frontend.
!packages/client-sdk
!apps/frontend
# The guide, copied into dist/guide/ by `vite build`.
!docs

# …minus installs, build output, local env and anything not needed to build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
apps/frontend/.env
apps/frontend/.env.local
apps/frontend/.env.*.local
apps/frontend/.env.development
apps/frontend/.env.staging
apps/frontend/test
apps/frontend/Dockerfile*
